          ["Australia", "Australian", "English"],
          ["the Philippines", "Filipino", "Filipino / English"],
          ["Egypt", "Egyptian", "Arabic"]
        ]
      },
      "note": "Las nacionalidades que terminan en **-ese** (Chinese, Japanese) y **-ch / -sh** (French, Spanish) no cambian en plural: **two Japanese**, **three Spanish**."
